<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是不是变量</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>但它的运行边界，由产品定义</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 420, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.0}}>02</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 8}}>个问题</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 708, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>模型能不能换？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 10}}>工具能不能加？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 20}}>不是「它不好」，是它替你决定了哪些可以改。</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 8}}>本 talk 框架（从评分卡「可部署 / 合规」两维拆出，非行业标准）</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>28 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
